<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Hi&nbsp;{{{Case.Contact_First_Name__c}}}<b>,</b></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><b>We’re sorry to hear that you’re dissatisfied with Admiral Business. Based on your recent communications, it appears that your concerns may meet the criteria for a formal complaint.</b></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">We’d like to take this opportunity to ask if you would like us to log this as a complaint so that we can investigate the matter further. If so, please reply with the specific points of your complaint in bullet point format. Once received, we will begin our investigation and keep you informed throughout the process.</span></p>

<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">At Admiral Business, we are committed to customer satisfaction and take all feedback seriously. Please let us know how you would like to proceed.</span></p>

<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><b>If we do not receive a response within 48 hours, we will assume that you do not wish to raise a formal complaint at this time.</b></span></p>
